UPDATE companies SET description='Electramatic was founded in 1963 in Minneapolis, Minnesota, and operates a 40,000-square-foot facility in the city’s Northeast neighborhood. The company has grown steadily since its inception, expanding its footprint to support improved production flow and manufacturing processes.

