UPDATE companies SET description='Electro Parts Inc operates from West Berlin in Berlin Township, New Jersey. The company serves military and general-industry customers from a facility Ownership structure and founding year are not publicly disclosed.

The shop provides electronic-component assembly, cable and wire-harness manufacturing, mechanical assembly, and part fabrication to military drawings or customer specifications. In-house fabrication capabilities include CNC milling, CNC turning, molding, forging, welding, plating, heat treating, and riveting. The company also sources or produces all required hardware such as brackets, washers, screws, and pins. Quality checks are performed at each production stage.

Electro Parts supplies both commercial and military markets. Military-grade items include AN/MS nuts, washers, and other hardware built to specification. Commercial product lines cover bearings, bushings, bolts, screws, heat-shrink tubing, pipe fittings, gaskets, O-rings, pins, seals, springs, and caps.

