UPDATE companies SET description='Elite Medical Care was founded in 2016 in Mabelvale, Arkansas, as a family-owned, full-service durable medical equipment provider. The company began with a focus on respiratory therapy and has expanded to serve all of Arkansas and roughly half of Mississippi.

