UPDATE companies SET description='Elite Spice Inc was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in Sparks, Nevada, with a corporate office in Jessup, Maryland. The company is privately held and American-owned, operating six facilities across the East and West coasts.

The company imports spices and operates as a custom manufacturer, producing pure spices, custom blended seasonings, capsicum products, onion and garlic ingredients, dehydrated fruits and vegetables, and other specialty food ingredients. Its manufacturing operations include cleaning, milling, blending, packaging, and proprietary microbial reduction and pathogen elimination systems. A culinary innovation center and multiple research and development laboratories support product development.

