UPDATE companies SET description='Endries Solar & Electric operates from Oostburg, Wisconsin, serving a territory that stretches from north of Green Bay through the Fox Valley to the Wisconsin-Illinois border. Russel Endries, a NABCEP-certified master electrician, installed his first solar system in 2008 and now serves as president.

The firm provides full-service solar installation for residential and commercial customers, handling design, permitting, installation, commissioning, inspection, and maintenance. All work is performed by the company''s own licensed and insured employees—no subcontractors are used. To date, the team has installed more than 1,000 photovoltaic systems, each designed by Russel Endries. The current staff includes eight people, among them a NABCEP-certified technical sales professional and a Tesla-certified installer with OSHA 30 and arc-flash credentials.

Endries Solar & Electric serves homeowners and businesses across southeastern and central Wisconsin. Its projects range from rooftop arrays on private residences to ground-mount systems for commercial facilities. The company is listed on Wisconsin''s Focus on Energy Trade Ally roster and holds national accreditation through NABCEP.

Russel Endries founded the business on a passion for clean energy and a goal of reducing customers'' ecological footprints while delivering long-term electricity savings. The company emphasizes that every system is owner-designed to maximize production and meet all code requirements, and it backs its work with a satisfaction guarantee.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP Accredited','Focus on Energy Trade Ally','NABCEP Certified PV Installation Professional','NABCEP Certified PV Technical Sales Professional','Tesla Certified Installer','OSHA 30','First Aid/CPR','ARC Flash']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar photovoltaic system design", "Permitting and paperwork management", "Residential solar installation", "Commercial solar installation", "System commissioning and inspection", "Solar maintenance and repair", "Energy usage analysis and system sizing", "Customized solar and electrical system engineering", "Grid-tied and battery backup system integration", "Ground-mount and rooftop mounting"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Renewable energy", "Solar photovoltaic"], "materials": ["Solar panels (Hanwha QCell, Boviet)", "Microinverters (Enphase IQ)", "Battery storage (Tesla Powerwall)", "Mounting hardware (ground-mount, rooftop)"], "equipment": ["Hanwha QCell modules", "Enphase IQ microinverters", "Boviet bi-facial modules", "Tesla Powerwall battery storage", "Enphase ground-mount photovoltaic system"], "volume": "Over 1,000 PV solar electrical systems installed", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All installations performed by licensed and insured employees, no subcontractors", "NABCEP accredited company", "Listed on Wisconsin''s Focus on Energy Trade Ally roster", "Owner-designed systems (over 1,000 installed)", "Team includes NABCEP-certified professionals and a Tesla-certified installer"], "facts_used": ["Located in Oostburg, Wisconsin -> db", "Owner Russel Endries, NABCEP certified master electrician, first system 2008 -> /about", "O