UPDATE companies SET description='Engineered Textile Products, Inc. (ETP) has operated from Mobile, Alabama since its founding in 1877.

The company specializes in custom fabrication of environmental and industrial textile products. All products are designed to customer specifications using premium materials suited for harsh environments, with production scaled for nationwide distribution and global export.

ETP serves the water management, agriculture, and manufacturing sectors, along with aerospace, education, maritime, sports, and event industries. Concrete installations include containment systems for NASA hangars, protective covers for high school athletic pits, port infrastructure at the Port of Mobile, and course marking for international triathlon events.

