UPDATE companies SET description='Era Wire Inc. was founded in 1988 by Richard T. Rae in West Haven, Connecticut. The company began as a wire straightening and cutting service and used wire machinery dealer. After physical expansion, the operation moved to its current location at 19- in West Haven in 1995. Following Richard''s passing in 2015, his son Rich Jr. assumed leadership, adding an on-site distribution warehouse and through-feed centerless grinding to create a one-stop shop for ferrous and non-ferrous wire needs.

The company specializes in precision wire straightening and cutting for round, flat, and shaped materials in all tempers and alloys. Its capabilities include through-feed centerless grinding as an alternative to turning and milling, heat treating, torsion straightening, and wire forming. A Quick Wire Program stocks pre-cut 304 spring-tempered stainless steel (including 304V and 316LVM), aluminum, copper, titanium, and high/low carbon steels for same-day shipping. The facility also provides wire machinery sales, parts, and tooling.

Era Wire serves the medical device industry as a primary focus, supplying precision-straightened Bright Diamond Drawn wire with zero surface marks for Swiss screw machining. The company''s ISO 9001:2015 certification and compliance with RoHS III, REACH Annex XVII, and California Proposition 65 support regulated sectors.

The founder''s original priority—servicing the customer first—remains the company''s stated differentiator, summarized in the tagline "We give it to you straight." Era Wire emphasizes its ISO 9001 certification since 2004, same-day shipping on stocked items, and the ability to process difficult materials without surface damage as reasons customers choose them.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','RoHS III','REACH Annex XVII','California Proposition 65','ISPM-15/IPPC','Conflict Minerals (3TG) compliance']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Precision wire straightening and cutting", "Through-feed centerless grinding", "Heat treating", "Torsion straightening", "Wire forming", "Quick wire program (same-day shipping)", "Pre-cut wire stocking", "Wire machinery sales", "Parts and tooling supply"], "industries": ["Medical device manufacturing", "Swiss screw machining", "Electronics", "General industrial"], "materials": ["Ferrous metals", "Non-ferrous metals", "Stainless steel (304, 304V, 316LVM)", "Aluminum", "Copper", "Titanium", "High carbon steel", "Low carbon steel", "Bright Diamond Drawn wire"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day shipping on stocked pre-cut wire", "tolerances": "Close/precision tolerances", "built_on": ["Same-day shipping on stocked pre-cut wire", "Through-feed centerless grinding as alternative to turning/milling", "Zero surface marks on Bright Diamond Drawn materials for medical applications", "ISO 9001 certified since 2004", "One-stop shop for ferrous and non-ferrous wire processing"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1988 by Richard T. Rae -> /", "Moved to West Haven, CT in 1995 -> /", "Rich Jr. took over in 2015, added distribution warehouse and centerless grinding -> /", "ISO 9001 certified since 2004 -> /quality", "RoHS III, REACH Annex XVII, California Proposition 65, ISPM-15/IPPC, Conflict Minerals compliance -> /quality", "Quick Wire Program with same-day shipping on stocked pre-cut wire -> /", "Precision medical wire focus, ze