UPDATE companies SET description='Erhardt Woodworks operates from a workshop and showroom in Bismarck, North Dakota, serving the surrounding communities of Mandan, Lincoln, and greater Burleigh and Morton Counties. The company fabricates custom cabinetry, epoxy resin tables, and live-edge furniture for residential, commercial, and industrial projects across the region.

The shop produces European-style cabinets, painted cabinets, MDF doors and drawer fronts, Baltic birch dovetail drawer boxes, epoxy resin tables, and live-edge countertops and tables. Work flows from design consultation through fabrication, finishing, delivery, and installation, all managed in-house. Materials include solid hardwoods, MDF, high-quality veneers, Baltic birch, and premium resin systems sourced from suppliers.

Customers range from homeowners remodeling kitchens or adding vanity cabinets to businesses outfitting commercial spaces. The company handles projects of varying scale — from a single live-edge table to full kitchen installations — and coordinates shipping or contractor-supported installation for clients outside its immediate service area.

Erhardt Woodworks emphasizes a commitment to customer satisfaction, attention to detail, and a skilled, experienced team. It positions its professional service as an alternative to DIY approaches, offering design collaboration, color and finish matching, reasonable pricing, flexible payment options, convenient hours, and a showroom where clients can view samples before committing.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinet fabrication (European style)", "Painted cabinet finishing", "MDF door and drawer front production", "Baltic birch dovetail drawer box fabrication", "Epoxy resin table fabrication", "Live-edge furniture and countertop fabrication", "Design consultation and project planning", "Color and finish matching", "Professional delivery", "On-site installation"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Industrial"], "materials": ["Solid hardwoods", "MDF (medium-density fiberboard)", "High-quality veneers", "Baltic birch", "Premium resin systems"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Smaller custom builds (vanity or accent cabinets): 4\u20136 weeks; full kitchen projects: 8\u201312 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Commitment to customer satisfaction and attention to detail", "Skilled, experienced cabinetmaking staff", "Design collaboration with color and finish matching", "Professional delivery and installation in the Bismarck region", "Showroom for in-person viewing of cabinetry, epoxy tables, and finishes"], "facts_used": ["Location: Bismarck, ND -> db, /, /about-us", "Services: custom cabinets, painted cabinets, MDF doors, epoxy resin tables, live-edge furniture -> /, /about-us", "Materials: solid hardwoods, MDF, veneers, Baltic birch, premium resin -> /", "Service area: Bismarck, Mandan, Lincoln, Burleigh/Morton Counties, select ND -> /", "Turnaround times: 4\u20136 weeks small, 8\u201312 weeks full kitchen -> /", "Processes: design, fabrication, delivery, installation -> /", "Showroom in Bismarck -> /