UPDATE companies SET description='Everbrite Electronics Inc., headquartered in Greenfield, Wisconsin, was founded in 1927. The company operates as a woman-owned and minority-owned business, certified as a Women''s Business Enterprise (WBE) since 2002. It began as a provider of visual identification solutions and has grown into one of the largest full-service signage companies in the United States.

Everbrite designs, manufactures, and installs a range of branding solutions including outdoor signage, indoor signs and displays, menu systems, architectural and drive-thru elements, electronic displays, scoreboards, and LED lighting. The company operates five sales and manufacturing facilities across the United States, offering multi-plant manufacturing capabilities and high-volume production capacity. A network of over 200 preferred installers provides nationwide installation and service, supported by site surveys, code research, permit procurement, and branding guideline development.

The company serves brands and retailers worldwide, managing Tier I and Tier II supplier diversity programs.

Everbrite differentiates itself through design and engineering excellence, state-of-the-art manufacturing, experienced account management, and consistent financial stability. Its status as the largest Minority/WBE signage company in the U.S. underscores its commitment to supplier diversity and customer satisfaction.', certifications=ARRAY['WBE (Women''s Business Enterprise)','WOMAN-OWNED']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Design", "Engineering", "Manufacturing (signage, LED lighting, scoreboards)", "Installation & Service", "Site Survey", "Code Research", "Branding Guidelines Development", "Permit Procurement", "Account Management", "LED Lighting Solutions", "Electronic Displays", "Scoreboards", "Menu Systems", "Architectural & Drive-thru Elements", "Indoor Signs & Displays", "Outdoor Signage", "Visual Identification Solutions"], "industries": ["Retail", "Commercial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Design and engineering excellence", "State-of-the-art manufacturing", "Multi-plant manufacturing capabilities", "High volume production capacity", "Nationwide installation and service network of over 200 preferred installers"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1927 -> /about", "Headquartered in Greenfield, Wisconsin -> /about", "Woman-owned and Minority-owned (WBE certified since 2002) -> /about and db", "Five sales and manufacturing facilities across the United States -> /about", "Multi-plant manufacturing capabilities and high volume production capacity -> /about", "Network of over 200 preferred installers for nationwide installation and service -> /about", "Design, engineering, manufacturing, installation, site survey, code research, permit procurement, branding guidelines -> /about and /", "Serves leading brands and retailers worldwide -> /about", "Largest Minority/WBE signage company in the U.S. -> /about", "Certifications: WBE (Women''s Business Enterprise), WOMAN-OWNED -> /about and db"], "company_typ