UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Naperville, Illinois, Evolution Furniture has built a reputation for custom-built furnishings since its inception. The company operates from a facility at 576 W. 5th Avenue, serving the Chicago metropolitan area with a focus on craftsmanship and quality in the design community.

The shop fabricates custom furniture from concept to installation, offering services that include custom furniture fabrication, restoration, upholstery, custom painting, and repair. A five-step process — Define, Discover, Design, Develop, Deliver — guides each project: the team analyzes client vision, researches materials and styles, produces sketches and 3D renderings, develops technical drawings for skilled craftsmen, and manages delivery and placement. The company emphasizes hands-on project management, handling sourcing, production, assembly, and on-site installation for orders ranging from single pieces to large commercial installations.

Evolution Furniture serves commercial businesses, residential homeowners, and interior designers across the Chicago region. Notable commercial projects include furnishings for Uber Headquarters, the Chicago Bears Halas Hall, Mondelez International, and the 1326 S Michigan development. The firm also partners with the American Society of Interior Designers (ASID) and lists a service area covering Naperville, Chicago, Glencoe, Barrington, Winnetka, and numerous surrounding suburbs.

The company states its promise is "distinctive custom furniture of incomparable quality, always delivered on time and on budget." Its approach centers on listening to client needs, evaluating the space firsthand, and collaborating closely through design iterations to ensure the final piece meets functional and aesthetic goals.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture fabrication", "Furniture restoration", "Upholstery", "Custom painted furniture", "Furniture repair", "Design (sketches, 3D renderings, models)", "Material selection and finishing", "Technical drawing development", "Project management", "Delivery and installation"], "industries": ["Commercial", "Residential", "Interior design"], "materials": ["Solid wood", "Wood veneer", "Laminate", "Glass", "Chrome", "Wood finishes"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Hands-on project management from design approval through delivery and installation", "Five-step design process: Define, Discover, Design, Develop, Deliver", "On-site space evaluation and client collaboration throughout design", "Partnership with the American Society of Interior Designers (ASID)", "Commitment to on-time, on-budget delivery of custom pieces"], "facts_used": ["Based in Naperville, Illinois -> /", "Specializes in custom-built furnishings for commercial and residential clients -> /", "Offers furniture restoration, upholstery, custom painting, and repair services -> /", "Employs a five-step design process: Define, Discover, Design, Develop, Deliver -> /", "Provides hands-on project management from design approval through delivery and installation -> /", "Completed projects for Uber Headquarters, Chicago Bears Halas Hall, Mondelez International, and 1326 S Michigan -> /", "Partners with the American Society of Interior Designers (ASID) -> /", "Serves the Chicago metropolitan area including Naperville, Chicago, Glencoe, Barrington, and other suburbs -> /", "Works with materials such as solid wood, veneer, laminate, glass, and chrome -> /", "Company type: Manufacturer -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Evolution Furniture specializes in creating unique, custom-built furnishings for both commercial businesses and residential homes.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='evolution-furniture' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Evolution St. Louis operates a high-tech knitting facility in St. Louis, Missouri, building on the city''s fashion industry heritage. The company was established to revitalize the flat-bed knit sector using the latest seamless knitting technology and to create new manufacturing jobs in the United States.

The facility runs STOLL ADF and CMS knit and wear® machines capable of 3D and complete garment knitting. It produces fully fashioned knits and sweaters knit to shape, footwear, smart textiles, and technical textiles, achieving complex shapes with minimal waste. Services include product engineering, prototyping, material sourcing and development, technology integration, IP protection, testing, linking, sewing, finishing, labeling, barcoding, and hangtag application. Small batch production is enabled by short setup times.

Customers span apparel, footwear, and accessories brands; technical and smart textile developers; automotive and aerospace suppliers; home and furniture makers; lifestyle, sports, health, and wellness companies; and medical technology, police, fire, and transit agencies. The company targets American brands and retailers seeking to keep pace with emerging trends.

Evolution St. Louis positions itself as creating the manufacturing facility and supply chain of the future, aiming to make St. Louis a hub for advanced knitting and manufacturing.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["3D knitting", "Complete garment knitting", "Fully-fashioned knitting", "Footwear knitting", "Smart textiles production", "Technical textiles production", "Small batch production", "Product engineering", "Prototyping", "Material sourcing", "Material development", "Technology integration", "IP protection", "Testing", "Linking", "Sewing", "Finishing", "Labeling", "Barcoding", "Hangtag application", "Complex shape knitting with minimal waste", "Demand-responsive production"], "industries": ["Apparel & Footwear & Accessories", "Technical & Smart Textiles", "Automotive & Aerospace", "Home & Furniture", "Lifestyle, Sports, Health & Wellness", "Medical Technology", "Medical, Police, Fire, Transit"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["STOLL ADF knit and wear\u00ae machines", "STOLL CMS knit and wear\u00ae machines", "High-tech flatbed knitting machines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["3D and complete garment seamless knitting on STOLL ADF/CMS machines", "Small batch capability with short setup times", "Complex shapes with minimal waste", "Integrated services from product engineering through finishing and labeling", "IP protection and technology integration for smart textiles"], "facts_used": ["Location: St. Louis, Missouri -> /", "High-tech knitting facility with 3D and complete garment seamless knitting technology -> /", "STOLL ADF and CMS knit and wear\u00ae machines with 3D and complete garment capabilities -> /capabilities", "Produces fully fashioned knits, footwear, smart textiles, technical textiles -> /capabilities", "Services: product engineering, prototyping, material sourcing/development, technology integration, IP protection, testing, linking, sewing, finishing, labeling, barcoding, hangtag -> /ca