UPDATE companies SET description='Experienced Solar is based in Albuquerque, New Mexico. The company was founded in 2015 by Kevin Goodreau, who brought 16 years of experience from his earlier venture, Direct Power & Water Corporation (DPW), started in 1993. In 2022, Goodreau’s son-in-law Mike Rogers acquired the business, continuing the legacy of the same core team that had made DPW a success.

The firm operates as a licensed electrical contractor (EE98 #390475) and a NABCEP-certified PV installer, providing turnkey design, engineering, and installation of grid-tied and remote solar systems for residential, commercial, and industrial clients. Services include site evaluation, custom engineering of autonomous solar arrays, solar carport construction, and integration of Generac generators and PWRcell energy storage. The company reports having completed hundreds of grid-tied installations over a decade with a sub-1% issue rate.

Experienced Solar serves customers across Albuquerque and surrounding communities in Bernalillo, Sandoval, Cibola, Valencia, Torrance, Santa Fe, and other New Mexico counties. Commercial clients include businesses seeking payback periods of three to five years through federal tax credits, MACRS depreciation, and gross receipts tax exemptions. The company also designs remote autonomous systems for off-grid applications.

The company differentiates itself through its emphasis on detailed site surveys—checking feeder cables, transformer sizing, panel bus ampacity, and roof conditions—before any proposal. Its founders cite competence in design and installation as critical to long-term performance, backed by direct customer access before, during, and after projects.', certifications=ARRAY['Licensed electrical contractor (EE98 #390475)','NABCEP Certified PV Installer']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar system design", "Solar system engineering", "Solar installation", "Grid-tied solar systems", "Remote/off-grid solar systems", "Solar carport installation", "Commercial solar services", "Site evaluation and survey", "Electric bill analysis", "Generac generator installation", "PWRcell clean energy systems", "Turnkey project management"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Industrial solar", "Renewable energy", "Electrical contracting"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Licensed electrical contractor (EE98 #390475)", "NABCEP Certified PV Installer", "Turnkey design and installation from conception to fruition", "Custom-engineered remote autonomous solar systems for maximum ROI", "Free consultation including electric bill analysis and peak demand charge identification"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2015 by Kevin Goodreau -> /about", "Mike Rogers bought the business in 2022 -> /about", "Licensed electrical contractor (EE98 #390475) -> /", "NABCEP Certified PV installer -> /", "Turnkey design, engineering, installation of grid-tied and remote solar systems -> /", "Services include site evaluation, custom engineering, solar carports, Generac generators, PWRcell -> /, /services", "Hundreds of grid-tied installations over a decade with sub-1% issue rate -> /", "Serves Albuquerque and surrounding counties -> /", "Commercial payback periods 3-5 years, tax credits, MACRS -> /services", "Emphasis on detailed s