UPDATE companies SET description='Exponent Assembly is based in Carrollton, Texas. The contract manufacturing company was founded in 1996 and has since built a reputation for customer service and quality.

The company provides a full range of electronics manufacturing services, including printed circuit board assembly (surface-mount, through-hole, and mixed technology), electromechanical assembly, wire harness and cable assembly, and box-build integration. Its capabilities extend to design and engineering, new product introduction, rapid prototyping, test development, inventory management, and component procurement. Equipment includes pick-and-place machines rated at 30,000 parts per hour, selective and wave soldering systems, 2D/3D automated optical inspection, and 3D solder paste inspection. Production volumes span from prototype runs to medium-to-large quantities, described as hundreds to thousands of boards per order.

Exponent Assembly serves customers in automotive, audio-visual, surveillance and optics, defense, computer and electronics, and industrial equipment sectors. Clients range from companies needing quick-turn prototyping to those requiring complete turnkey solutions with traceable sourcing and scheduled deliveries.

The company emphasizes a quality management system certified to ISO 9001:2015, with adherence to IPC-A-610 and J-STD-001 workmanship standards and ESD S20.20 handling procedures. Its stated goal is 100-percent on-time delivery backed by an experienced, flexible staff that aims to deliver cost-effective, high-quality products.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','IPC-A-610','J-STD-001','ESD S20.20']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB Assembly (Surface Mount Technology)", "PCB Assembly (Through-Hole Technology)", "PCB Assembly (Mixed Technology)", "Electromechanical Assembly", "Wire Harness and Cable Assembly", "Box Build Integration", "2D/3D Automated Optical Inspection", "3D Solder Paste Inspection", "Selective Soldering", "Wave Soldering", "Hand Soldering", "Rework and Repair Services", "Test Development Services", "Design and Engineering", "New Product Introduction", "Rapid Prototyping", "Medium-Large Volume Production", "Consignment PCBA", "Complete Turnkey PCBA", "Semi Turnkey PCBA", "Inventory Management", "Component Procurement", "IPC-A-610 Certified Inspection Staff"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Audio Visual", "Surveillance & Optics", "Defense", "Computer & Electronics", "Industrial Equipment"], "materials": ["Lead-free (RoHS) solder", "Leaded solder", "Various cables and connectors"], "equipment": ["Pick-and-place machines (30,000 parts per hour)", "Selective soldering machine", "Wave soldering machine", "2D/3D Automated Optical Inspection system", "3D Solder Paste Inspection system", "Automated flux sprayers", "Preheating zones"], "volume": "Prototype to medium-large volume (hundreds to thousands of boards)", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system", "IPC-A-610 and J-STD-001 workmanship standards compliance", "Pick-and-place machines placing 30,000 parts per hour", "2D/3D automated optical inspection and 3D solder paste inspection", "Complete turnkey solutions with safe sourcing and inve