UPDATE companies SET description='F.A.T.S. Parts operates from Anchorage, Alaska, where it supplies automotive parts and provides repair services through two locations on International Airport Road. The business, also known as Foreign Auto & Truck Supply, runs a parts counter at 202 E International Airport Road and a service shop at 209 E International Airport Road. No founding year, ownership structure, or founder names are publicly disclosed.

The company stocks a broad range of replacement parts for virtually any make and model and backs them with a 12-month or 12,000-mile parts-and-labor warranty. Its service shop performs tune-ups, fuel-injection service, I/M certified emissions testing and repair, front-end alignments, tire services, pre-purchase inspections, electrical work, brake service, and scheduled maintenance. Facility size, headcount, and annual volume figures are not published.

F.A.T.S. serves individual vehicle owners and fleets in the Anchorage area and beyond, covering domestic and foreign passenger cars, light trucks, and performance vehicles. Its customer base includes drivers needing routine maintenance, emissions compliance, or emergency repairs.

The company emphasizes factory-tested parts that are inspected before sale, same-day availability for most common components, and a guarantee that covers both parts and labor for a full year or 12,000 miles. It also highlights I/M certification for emissions work and a staff that advises on part selection for everything from family sedans to high-performance cars.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Auto repair and service tune-up", "I/M certified testing and repair", "Front end alignments", "Tire services", "Pre-buyer inspections", "Electrical system diagnosis and repair", "Brake service", "Scheduled maintenance", "Fuel injection service", "Automotive parts distribution"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "Auto repair and maintenance", "Vehicle inspection and emissions testing", "Automotive parts distribution"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["12-month/12,000-mile parts and labor warranty", "I/M certified emissions testing and repair", "Factory-tested parts with pre-sale inspection", "Same-day parts availability for most makes and models", "Separate parts counter and service shop in Anchorage"], "facts_used": ["Location: 202 E International Airport Rd, Anchorage, AK 99518 -> /", "Service location: 209 E International Airport Rd, Anchorage, AK 99518 -> /", "Phone numbers and emails for parts and service -> /", "Parts & labor guaranteed for 12 months or 12,000 miles -> /", "Services: tune-up, fuel injection, I/M certified testing, alignments, tire services, pre-buyer inspections, electrical, brakes, scheduled maintenance -> /", "Factory-tested parts, pre-sale inspection -> /", "Same-day parts availability for most makes/models -> /", "Company name: Foreign Auto & Truck Supply (copyright) -> /", "Website: fatsparts.com -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "F.A.T.S. Parts is Anchorage''s quality car parts supplier", "f