UPDATE companies SET description='Fabric Factory operates from a showroom at 1421 NW 23rd Street in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma. The company sells medium to high-end upholstery and drapery fabrics and runs a custom in-house workroom. No founding year, ownership structure, or founders are disclosed in public sources.

